# ALFRED does not require any environment variables to run or to build.
#
# GitHub tokens and OpenRouter API keys are entered by the user in the
# session-setup screen and sent from the browser to this app's own route
# handlers per-request. They are never persisted to disk, environment
# variables, or Git, and demo mode needs no credentials at all.
#
# This file is intentionally near-empty; it exists to document that fact
# and as a place to add local-only, non-secret overrides if you need them.
